        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c6e44c9e-753e-3edb-bf7f-a4e75481d859",
                "word": "volgooien",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "93da2160-b67f-3522-b531-bbe8082beff4",
                        "entry_id": "c6e44c9e-753e-3edb-bf7f-a4e75481d859",
                        "glosses": [
                            "op een ruwe, onnadenkende, slordige manier iets helemaal vullen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d84375e0-4e3e-4edb-af14-737fe572fdb7",
                                "sense_id": "93da2160-b67f-3522-b531-bbe8082beff4",
                                "text": "Nixon schrikt er niet voor terug. \"Onze leiders laten ons in de steek\", zei ze. \"Er moet iets veranderen. We willen dat onze regering weer aan het werk gaat ten behoeve van de gezondheidszorg, een einde maakt aan het volgooien van de gevangenissen en onze kapotte metro repareert.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f90b9269-fa7a-41cf-9564-7049c772665a",
                                "sense_id": "93da2160-b67f-3522-b531-bbe8082beff4",
                                "text": "Stop met de gedachte van het volgooien van het buitengebied met windturbines. Twee van de vijf geschetste toekomstscenario's die voor 'Enschede wekt op' zijn opgesteld gaan ervan uit dat de duurzame doelstellingen louter door middel van windenergie worden behaald. Dat betekent in de praktijk zoiets als de bouw van 29 'losse' windmolens met een tiphoogte van 132 meter. Slechts 105 deelnemers (bijna 10 procent) aan onze enquête zeggen iets te voelen voor de komst van zo'n groot aantal windmolens."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b603f859-251f-302f-b2e1-89c5a8f1bda3",
                        "entry_id": "c6e44c9e-753e-3edb-bf7f-a4e75481d859",
                        "glosses": [
                            "de brandstoftank van een voertuig helemaal vullen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bb9275a-2457-4460-9798-ed63ea5f83ad",
                                "sense_id": "b603f859-251f-302f-b2e1-89c5a8f1bda3",
                                "text": "De interesse van consumenten was toch al beperkt. Een woordvoerster van Shell sluit niet uit dat TapUp op termijn ook weer auto's van particulieren op locatie gaat volgooien."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fad1371-dd05-4096-81d6-98405dd5f7c9",
                                "sense_id": "b603f859-251f-302f-b2e1-89c5a8f1bda3",
                                "text": "Bij een stop langs de snelweg kun je binnenkort je auto niet alleen meer \"volgooien\" met diesel, benzine of lpg, maar ook met stroom. Nog dit jaar komen laadpunten voor elektrische auto's op twintig Shell-stations in de Randstad."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "490806cd-b9fe-3dc5-98ba-5f55518b46a5",
                        "entry_id": "c6e44c9e-753e-3edb-bf7f-a4e75481d859",
                        "glosses": [
                            "overmatig veel alcohol drinken"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a008b5d9-69e5-4f9c-a5b5-5b433c8e3604",
                                "sense_id": "490806cd-b9fe-3dc5-98ba-5f55518b46a5",
                                "text": "Hirscher, die onder het kunstlicht op de Oostenrijkse piste zijn zesde seizoenszege, behaalde, verontschuldigde zich voor het wangedrag van zijn landgenoten bij Kristoffersen. \"Beschamend\", verzuchtte de winnaar. Kristoffersen kwam met vuurspuwende ogen en woedend over de finish. Hij reageerde nog niet op het incident. Twitteraars weten de onsportieve acties aan het moment van de wedstrijd in Schladming, in de avonduren. Fans kunnen zich zodoende gedurende de dag volgooien."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f03d66ee-8211-46cc-a93f-6fc561ee7411",
                        "source_entry_id": "c6e44c9e-753e-3edb-bf7f-a4e75481d859",
                        "source_sense_id": "93da2160-b67f-3522-b531-bbe8082beff4",
                        "target_lang_word": "fill",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a06d2558-dbc0-3198-bd82-ec06650c56dd",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make full",
                                            "To add contents to (a container, cavity, or the like) so that it is full."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ergative",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07f88570-4e28-47b9-b407-b4c3716a192a",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d2558-dbc0-3198-bd82-ec06650c56dd",
                                                "text": "She filled a glass with milk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3eaf2b5-3636-4f4e-b9fb-8f09a293b188",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d2558-dbc0-3198-bd82-ec06650c56dd",
                                                "text": "My hopes wa'n't disappointed. I never saw clams thicker than they was along them inshore flats. I filled my dreener in no time, and then it come to me that 'twouldn't be a bad idee to get a lot more, take 'em with me to Wellmouth, and peddle 'em out. Clams was fairly scarce over that side of the bay and ought to fetch a fair price."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96e2f2b1-ee6b-499c-b728-a4a2d979f907",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d2558-dbc0-3198-bd82-ec06650c56dd",
                                                "text": "She continued to frown as she filled Bony's cup and added brandy to her own."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42556599-3db8-4a79-bb27-41e2f29caaef",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d2558-dbc0-3198-bd82-ec06650c56dd",
                                                "text": "She forgave him the pain as he filled the cavity in her back molar. Three weeks later, she let him fill a more intimate cavity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3a64d50-cdab-4e3e-bd7c-bafe9bd5fd94",
                                                "sense_id": "a06d2558-dbc0-3198-bd82-ec06650c56dd",
                                                "text": "Grat Herendeen was the first man, a huge man with his bull whip coiled and over his shoulder seeming almost a part of him. He grinned at her as she filled his plate with the eggs and motioned toward the bacon. \"Help yourself, Grat.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7be4baa-2441-33cd-a2b2-fd9a29152c59",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make full",
                                            "To enter (something), making it full."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ergative",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf560366-7596-4dbc-8f2b-db1f74dde177",
                                                "sense_id": "a7be4baa-2441-33cd-a2b2-fd9a29152c59",
                                                "text": "The doors opened and guests filled the auditorium."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b32450d6-a54c-43a8-a1a6-d50e88a2c776",
                                                "sense_id": "a7be4baa-2441-33cd-a2b2-fd9a29152c59",
                                                "text": "In the evening of the 14th of July, there was a rainfall of 3 or 3½ inches in that locality. The water filled the ditch so full that it overflowed the levees on both sides in many places […] ."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd9a6861-6b4d-47cc-b79f-a75068a0197f",
                                                "sense_id": "a7be4baa-2441-33cd-a2b2-fd9a29152c59",
                                                "text": "As the crowd filled the aisles, S repeated loudly what he had announced upon entering the stadium: 'I don't want anyone to touch me, and I will call the police if anyone does.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a1298e4-ad95-31c8-8829-b99169c06aa3",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make full",
                                            "To occupy fully, to take up all of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ergative",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7b7a554-d032-4b5c-baa7-fe22168b31f9",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1298e4-ad95-31c8-8829-b99169c06aa3",
                                                "text": "The smell of spring filled the air."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "280e70a3-549c-49b7-b805-1ad83bf8f54f",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1298e4-ad95-31c8-8829-b99169c06aa3",
                                                "text": "[…]the drums began to thunder, the sound of trumpets filled the air, the earth trembled beneath their feet, and the hearts of the gazing multitude throbbed with suspense and expectation[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3674e441-7bf8-4ab5-b9e6-bfdc993307a8",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1298e4-ad95-31c8-8829-b99169c06aa3",
                                                "text": "And now that I have given the one chapter to the theme that so filled my heart, and so often made it ache and ache again, I pass on, unhindered, to the event that had impended over me longer yet[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb98c0ba-90ca-3706-8031-c9fc14e96473",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become full."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3a75f0e-5f8d-4442-827e-ae0c13fd5ea6",
                                                "sense_id": "cb98c0ba-90ca-3706-8031-c9fc14e96473",
                                                "text": "The bucket filled with rain"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bd71a5e-0bbe-4683-b1db-08f4f76263fc",
                                                "sense_id": "cb98c0ba-90ca-3706-8031-c9fc14e96473",
                                                "text": "The room filled with thick smoke."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8a138b0-d310-4aea-b9e5-1f6a309ec325",
                                                "sense_id": "cb98c0ba-90ca-3706-8031-c9fc14e96473",
                                                "text": "The sails fill with wind"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "109d3d55-8bca-3c79-90d6-250137a01255",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become full.",
                                            "To become pervaded with something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6912c76a-2759-4deb-8541-17d036870501",
                                                "sense_id": "109d3d55-8bca-3c79-90d6-250137a01255",
                                                "text": "My heart filled with joy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a61c565d-e4a4-3561-9b9c-f48f1cfc2200",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To satisfy or obey (an order, request, or requirement)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27101cda-2bb8-44e0-af30-1a87ec2300e6",
                                                "sense_id": "a61c565d-e4a4-3561-9b9c-f48f1cfc2200",
                                                "text": "To qualify for a home loan, you need to fill a number of requirements."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f09be007-7e6e-4f3a-af57-4fb96aba8cdd",
                                                "sense_id": "a61c565d-e4a4-3561-9b9c-f48f1cfc2200",
                                                "text": "The pharmacist filled my prescription for penicillin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "675bf953-54ca-4ab8-95d6-a09a78d20c8a",
                                                "sense_id": "a61c565d-e4a4-3561-9b9c-f48f1cfc2200",
                                                "text": "We can't let the library close! It fills a great need in the community."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0567ab3b-36f1-3d01-85c0-5c6b152012e4",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To install someone, or be installed, in (a position or office), eliminating a vacancy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90765ae3-61b9-497a-bdff-237b45c2a2f3",
                                                "sense_id": "0567ab3b-36f1-3d01-85c0-5c6b152012e4",
                                                "text": "The board of supervisors called a specal election to fill the office, and at such special election Henry C. Andrews was elected judge of probate to fill out the said term."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8a863f2-5e3e-453d-bf29-4a9cbc7ca99d",
                                                "sense_id": "0567ab3b-36f1-3d01-85c0-5c6b152012e4",
                                                "text": "Sorry, no more applicants. The position has been filled."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41561c66-4dad-31a9-b9de-23e295d1043f",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To treat (a tooth) by adding a dental filling to it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe6896c3-9e7d-420c-8ae0-1c708813bbf7",
                                                "sense_id": "41561c66-4dad-31a9-b9de-23e295d1043f",
                                                "text": "Dr. Smith filled Jim's cavity with silver amalgam."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25a562d8-d395-482c-ab2d-aa19fb3b8d66",
                                                "sense_id": "41561c66-4dad-31a9-b9de-23e295d1043f",
                                                "text": "Be that as it may, had the disturbance continued after our having filled the molar, and presuming that nothing had been done to the bicuspid, we might have been still as far as ever from knowing where the trouble lay."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11b6039d-242b-3c0e-bdff-93a67c0efdac",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To block, obstruct"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7811556e-32ff-4119-a8c1-5932f8e4f38a",
                                                "sense_id": "11b6039d-242b-3c0e-bdff-93a67c0efdac",
                                                "text": "The drains were filled with gunk and no water could flow off."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08b474d8-b31f-3cf1-a26a-7003c3339ffc",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To supply fully with food; to feed; to satisfy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a884524a-3aad-4ecc-86a4-d25135b2e773",
                                                "sense_id": "08b474d8-b31f-3cf1-a26a-7003c3339ffc",
                                                "text": "Are all the children filled and ready for bed?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83d196e0-66c4-4fcf-838d-7761fdd841fd",
                                                "sense_id": "08b474d8-b31f-3cf1-a26a-7003c3339ffc",
                                                "text": "Whence should we have so much bread in the wilderness, as to fill so great a multitude?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f574cfc3-f384-4c05-b9fa-0494ef441d25",
                                                "sense_id": "08b474d8-b31f-3cf1-a26a-7003c3339ffc",
                                                "text": "Things that are sweet and fat are more filling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a80529e3-cf6a-3cae-91bc-3f2a13bf1f9d",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To trim (a yard) so that the wind blows on the after side of the sails."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "988da243-f680-3d42-bfb6-b9051998dbf3",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have sexual intercourse with (a female)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25570718-69a4-4fc7-a201-a96530d8548a",
                                                "sense_id": "988da243-f680-3d42-bfb6-b9051998dbf3",
                                                "text": "Did you fill that girl last night?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e0768ad-4d43-3fc9-a6a0-badecdaec4c9",
                                        "entry_id": "60b4355e-0264-3deb-bbf2-fe493d35ad3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To ejaculate inside someone or something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive",
                                            "vulgar"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fill",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "385c3975-b4c9-3a00-a560-e4d8d067e242",
                                        "entry_id": "005a5b33-d9b1-3ce6-b60e-8c1748adb86d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sufficient or more than sufficient amount."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17c92baf-4fc5-41bf-a27f-9110c84f5b2e",
                                                "sense_id": "385c3975-b4c9-3a00-a560-e4d8d067e242",
                                                "text": "Don't feed him any more: he's had his fill."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "007d8e2a-0ab2-4db3-b6ff-e9148f34fd81",
                                                "sense_id": "385c3975-b4c9-3a00-a560-e4d8d067e242",
                                                "text": "Then they set somewhat of food before me, whereof I ate my fill, and gave me somewhat of clothes wherewith I clad myself anew and covered my nakedness; after which they took me up into the ship, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9208804c-ae68-3aba-bfdd-421d35686384",
                                        "entry_id": "005a5b33-d9b1-3ce6-b60e-8c1748adb86d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An amount that fills a container."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9729ba31-7499-4e65-88ed-159ff948e8f5",
                                                "sense_id": "9208804c-ae68-3aba-bfdd-421d35686384",
                                                "text": "The mixer returned to the plant for another fill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62294734-76d3-31d3-b86d-a60cd0049e12",
                                        "entry_id": "005a5b33-d9b1-3ce6-b60e-8c1748adb86d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The filling of a container or area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "846036d0-75bb-4f0e-863c-ddafb9ccc752",
                                                "sense_id": "62294734-76d3-31d3-b86d-a60cd0049e12",
                                                "text": "That machine can do 20 fills per minute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "954ac1c2-134a-4302-8b7a-0b9c1fae5964",
                                                "sense_id": "62294734-76d3-31d3-b86d-a60cd0049e12",
                                                "text": "This paint program supports lines, circles, and textured fills."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1e89247-fc60-3d88-bb9a-6aa89a62650f",
                                        "entry_id": "005a5b33-d9b1-3ce6-b60e-8c1748adb86d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inexpensive material used to occupy empty spaces, especially in construction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbca23b8-d9c1-44dd-96f0-30bcc78a3893",
                                                "sense_id": "c1e89247-fc60-3d88-bb9a-6aa89a62650f",
                                                "text": "The ruins of earlier buildings were used as fill for more recent construction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc620544-eb40-43ce-aced-269af96cb86d",
                                                "sense_id": "c1e89247-fc60-3d88-bb9a-6aa89a62650f",
                                                "text": "Strippage from a borrow area was first treated as waste, under the contract, but after passage of time was suitable for fill and was so used."
                                            }
                                        ]
